# Generated drawings and parts, at the repo root only. Anchored with a leading slash:
# a bare "data/" also matches tests/data/, which silently kept the 323-string callout
# corpus -- the whole M6 acceptance gate -- out of the repository. It passed locally,
# where the file exists untracked, and failed collection on every clean checkout.
